OL,3,GNEWSACould the ear replace the
OL,4,Afingertip for oxygen monitoring?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of people were introduced to
OL,7,Ffingertip pulse oximeters during the
OL,8,FCovid-19 pandemic. The small devices,
OL,9,Fwhich measure blood oxygen levels, are
OL,10,Fnow widely available from some online
OL,11,Fretailers for less than #20.
OL,13,FBut researchers have raised concerns
OL,14,Fabout the accuracy of the traditional
OL,15,Foximeter for people with darker skin
OL,16,Ftones, due to the technology it uses to
OL,17,Fgenerate a reading.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
